## What changed

Updates `baseline/README.md`, the README shown when opening the repository's `baseline/` directory, so it explicitly documents the newly merged one-head nanoGPT / FineWeb-Edu baseline.

The revised README now includes:

- the one-head nanoGPT row in the top baseline table;
- the one-block, one-head architecture and pinned document-disjoint FineWeb-Edu protocol;
- SGD, AdamW, and Muon reference hyperparameters and schedules;
- the exact `WeightWatcher.analyze(ERG=True, randomize=True, ...)` contract;
- per-epoch loss, accuracy, perplexity, BLEU, alpha, ERG-gap, and `num_traps` outputs;
- the four notebooks and uncertainty presentation;
- restartable checkpoint and Apple-MPS run instructions;
- the updated recommended benchmark ladder.

This is a documentation-only follow-up to PR #24. It changes only `baseline/README.md`.
